ecret=\"YOUR_CLIENT_SECRET\"\n2. Update VS Code Settings: After you successfully log in with the command above:\n\nGo to VS Code Settings.\nSearch for cloudcode.authMethod.\nSet it to gcloud.\nReload the window.\n3. Check your Tier: To see your tier and rate limits (which I also cannot see):\n\nGo to the Google Cloud Console Quotas Page.\nFilter for \"Gemini for Google Cloud API\".\nGenerated by Gemini 3 Pro Preview\nPrompts to try\n1 context item\nDefault"}
